206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The project covers offline, local generation of candidate passwords and offline verification against self-created sample hashes. It does not implement online authentication attempts, does not support salted or modern password-hashing schemes \(bcrypt, Argon2, scrypt, etc.\), does not use GPU acceleration or rainbow tables, and does not perform any network activity. All data used for demonstration is invented. Production deployment, integration with hashcat/John the Ripper, and large-scale enterprise password audits are outside the scope of this mini project.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
